  "Callum REES statement 4 18-12-2024": [
    {
      "heading": null,
      "paragraphs": [
        "Occurrence number: 7215489036",
        "URN:",
        "Statement of: REES, Callum",
        "Age:",
        "Occupation: Police officer",
        "Statement date: 18/12/2024",
        "This statement is true to the best of my knowledge and belief, and I make it knowing that, if it is tendered in evidence, I shall be liable to prosecution if I have wilfully stated in it, anything which I know to be false, or do not believe to be true.",
        "I am Police Constable 9774 REES and I am currently employed by Merseyside Police in the capacity of Response Police Officer based at Liverpool CENTRAL POLICE STATION.",
        "I have been allocated as Officer in Case for occurrence 7215489036 which relates to a case of domestic assault by Daniel PALMER against now ex-partner Chloe BARRETT",
        "On 08/11/2024, I was present for the arrest of PALMER and assisted with his interview whilst in custody.",
        "Following his release from custody, I have conducted a review of the contents of his mobile phone, exhibit MP/02, using the XAMN software for any communication relating to the incident.",
        "I can exhibit the following, which have been exported from XAMN and provided in PDF format.",
        "Exhibit SH/01 - Screenshot of a WhatsApp message sent to the contact Chloe Mum by PALMER which states \"Go pick up your daughter from her friends if you don't wanna lose another kid\"",
        "Exhibit SH/02 - Export of conversation on WhatsApp between BARRETT and PALMER on 02/11/2024, the offence date. Communication between victim and PALMER referring to incident after taking place.",
        "Most notably, this conversation contains:",
        "From Chloe to Daniel - \"You bit my chin, I got a black eye, no need for it\"",
        "From Chloe to Daniel - \"You fucking hit me, you don't love me\"",
        "From Chloe to Daniel - \"Pack your shit and leave by dinner time or I will call the police, you don't hit me, you fucked up\" to which Daniel replies \"OK I have no choice but to\" BARRETT replies \"How, no excuse\" Daniel replies \"So did u\"",
        "From Chloe to Daniel - \"I didn't pull your hair, slap you, give you black eye and you bit my chin, fuck off\" to which he replies \"No I didn't, we were making love\".",
        "Chloe replies \"You did, fuck off out my life now, no I was on fridge you dragged me down\". Daniel replies \"OK call me\" to which she replies \"No, just go, leave me alone\"",
        "Chloe has also sent images of her injuries, the same as exhibited, to as well as some additional images of bruising to arms.",
        "There is further communication from Daniel to Chloe which is ignored generally pleading to meet with him and also him accusing her of cheating on him prior to the incident taking place.",
        "From Daniel to Chloe - \"I can’t even believe you cheated on me you can say no you haven’t but you weren’t yourself and from what I’ve heard on the phone I know you have everyone knows their lady and I No mine\".",
        "From Daniel to Chloe - \"We’re done Now you can give kids the news they wanted hear Once upon a time there was a muppet you a r good at belittling people And you have good excuse You were right i am a loser\"",
        "There is no further communication.",
        "I have nothing further to add or clarify in connection with this incident.",
        "Signature of witness",
        "Name: 9774 REES, Callum",
        "Date: 18/12/2024",
        "Time: 16:07",
        "Signature witnessed by",
        "Name:",
        "Date:",
        "Time:"
      ]
    }
  ],
