        "PALMER: \"No, I've got no reason to slap her or hit her.\"",
        "[35:23] PC 1638: \"So, I am aware that left the address during this incident and you say you weren't too sure where she went and you said you sent a message basically, it read … if you do not pick your daughter up, you are going to lose another child.\"",
